# Local MinIO data dir (dev-only S3-compatible object storage) — see
# docs/19-unique-differentiators.md / api StorageService setup.
.minio-data/

# macOS Finder metadata
.DS_Store

# Local scratch files holding real credentials. Never commit these — the repo
# is private, but a private repo is not a secret store: collaborators, forks,
# and any later flip to public all expose whatever is in the history, and
# `git add -A` sweeps up untracked files at the root without asking.
password.md
secrets.md
credentials.md
*.secrets
